      "detailed_description": "&quot;Violent Horror Stories: anthology&quot; is an anthology of horror games from different authors. Each game represents the authors' take on the theme of &quot;pursuit&quot; with its own visual design, gameplay, and story. The average completion time for each game is 15-30 minutes.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nGAMES IN THE ANTHOLOGY:<br />\r\n- &quot;I ate old man's liver now this b***ch is mine&quot; — a psychological arthouse horror about the loss of virginity.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n- &quot;No, i'm not a human i'm a ɿ̲̻ ʍ́ ρ̇̎Ծ̬͎Տ̯ͦ Ե̧͗_ͅ_̝̆ȝ̍ͯՐ͂͡&quot; — an intimate story about a disaster and guests from underground. People are breaking into your home, but not all of them are true people.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n- &quot;Sensation&quot; — become a reporter for Japanese television and do not lose your &quot;Sensation,&quot; a famous actress who behaves extremely suspiciously. Discover her secret by finding necessary items on location and pressing them in time. Time slips away from you, just like the actress herself.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n- &quot;All along the toon tower&quot; — a cartoonish cat in cyclical existential horror tries to escape using his wits and an axe.",
